{"version":1,"content":"<p>新華社報道，中國工農紅軍長征勝利90周年到來之際，正在中國空間站執行任務的神舟二十三號航天員乘組，以在軌視頻形式向偉大長征深情致敬，告慰紅軍先輩「任務進展順利，祖國繁榮昌盛，我們不負重托」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:01.059914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:25:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:49.806683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:49.806683+00:00","content_hash":"95cda24b6e496daa5f43350c30ea8dbbcefd804a9e132786507ecad6c7dfad95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}